  "description": "AAJExtensions is a lightweight C# library providing extension methods for object conversion to common data types. \nIt simplifies type casting by offering methods like ToInt(), ToDateTime(), ToBool(), ToLong(), ToDecimal(), and ToDouble(), reducing repetitive Convert.ToX calls. \nIdeal for improving code readability and efficiency.",
