  "published": "2025-03-21T03:11:44.833Z",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.0.0 - Initial Release (2025-03-21)\n- Added ToInt() for converting objects to integers.\n- Added ToDateTime() for converting objects to DateTime.\n- Added ToBool() for converting objects to boolean values.\n- Added ToLong() for converting objects to long integers.\n- Added ToDecimal() for converting objects to decimal values.\n- Added ToDouble() for converting objects to double values.\n- Optimized conversion performance with direct Convert.ToX methods.",
